      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include zolpidem tartrate as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 216 tablets of the 12.5 mg extended-release tablet (NDC 00781531631, labeler Sandoz Inc) with 34.8 days on hand at current use.",
      "cites": ["D1", "E1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale Lakeside holds 12 tablets of the same product with 5.4 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D3", "E3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked option by rule is to transfer 19 tablets of 12.5 mg from Corvale East to Corvale Lakeside, which would leave Corvale East with about two weeks of supply and bring Corvale Lakeside to 14 days.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "This transfer requires pharmacy director approval and a controlled-substance transfer record for Schedule III-V.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "An alternate manufacturer option (ACI Healthcare USA, Inc.) is ranked third, but its label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D7"]
    }
  ]
